e Of Grace, Broadcast y el «hard electronica» de Add N To X. Japón sobresale en el kitsch paródico y futurista: Pizzicato Five, Cibo Matto, Fantastic Plastic Machine, Buffalo Daughter, Cornelius. Y fuera: Air (Moon Safari), Mocket, Komeda, Stereo Total, Beanfield, Le Hammond Inferno.","color":"#f472b6","family":"Pop, power-pop y synth-pop","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#retro-futurism"},{"id":80907546100315,"name":"Shibuya-kei","book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","start":1993,"end":2002,"desc":"El pop del distrito tokiota de Shibuya: «un pastiche de mil cosas no japonesas» (Cornelius) que mezcla ritmos de baile y estructuras pop con todo lo que haya a mano. Pizzicato Five, Towa Tei (Deee-Lite), Fantastic Plastic Machine, Buffalo Daughter; las recopilaciones Sushi del sello alemán Bungalow lo dieron a conocer en Europa.","color":"#f472b6","family":"Rock, synth-pop y canción","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#shibuya-kei"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":231141305096994,"artist":"Pizzicato Five","artist_id":134921440653862,"title":"Couples","year":1987,"ess":0,"yt":"p2MDHcC2mKw","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Retrofuturismo y kitsch","scene_id":137971665577593,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#retro-futurism","chapters":["Sección 6.11"],"pages":[[1,273,null]]},{"id":204564368253202,"artist":"Pizzicato Five","artist_id":134921440653862,"title":"Lover's Rock","year":1990,"ess":0,"yt":"WcZE3dh2bb4","kind":"s","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Retrofuturismo y kitsch","scene_id":137971665577593,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#retro-futurism","chapters":["Sección 6.11"],"pages":[[1,273,null]]},{"id":145782885812400,"artist":"Pizzicato Five","artist_id":134921440653862,"title":"This Year's Girl","year":1991,"ess":0,"yt":"8jbkBBOtAG8","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Retrofuturismo y kitsch","scene_id":137971665577593,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#retro-futurism","chapters":["Sección 6.11"],"pages":[[1,273,null]]},{"id":119418941879714,"artist":"Pizzicato Five","artist_id":134921440653862,"title":"Bossa Nova","year":1993,"ess":0,"yt":"oAC5fyvZtAw","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Retrofuturismo y kitsch","scene_id":137971665577593,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#retro-futurism","chapters":["Sección 6.11"],"pages":[[1,273,null]]},{"id":5265317957894,"artist":"Pizzicato Five","artist_id":134921440653862,"title":"The Sound of Music by Pizzicato Five","year":1995,"ess":1,"yt":"Ah1Mk7YLAuk","kind":null,"book":{"id":10,"title":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/"},"scene":"Shibuya-kei","scene_id":80907546100315,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#shibuya-kei","chapters":["Cap. 17: Como una autopista: encuentros de electrónica y música popular (1989-2002)"],"pages":[]},{"id":114267247099565,"artist":"Pizzicato Five","artist_id":134921440653862,"title":"Happy End Of The World","year":1997,"ess":0,"yt":"09Ie6pM6ZJk","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Retrofuturismo y kitsch","scene_id":137971665577593,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#retro-futurism","chapters":["Sección 6.11"],"pages":[[1,273,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":273,"text":"…more mature symphony of tones and textures. Japanese Kitsch Japanese bands excelled at this parodistic and futuristic approach to kitsch and muzak. Pizzicato Five (1), who had turned supermarket muzak into a sub-genre of synth-pop on Couples (1987), became one of the leading retro' bands when they enrolled…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":274,"text":"…the genres of his childhood. Le Hammond Inferno, the project of Berlin-based producers and disc-jockeys Marcus Liesenfeld and Holger Beier, copied Pizzicato Five on Easy Listening Superstar (1999). Post-pop Radiohead (2), the most hyped and probably the most over-rated band of the decade, upped the ante for…"},{"book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","page":333,"text":"…toda referencia que haya a mano, dando albergue en su (ingenua) celebración de la música a todo sonido sensual. Enemigos tenaces del purismo, Pizzicato Five fueron la joya de la corona. La cantante-megadiva Maki Nomiya y el productor Yasuharu Konishi, que actualmente detenta el sello de club-pop…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":231141305096994,"type":"album","name":"Couples","list_id":66701177312920,"list":"RYM Top — Easy Listening","src":"musthear","rank":121,"year":1987,"note":null,"yt":"p2MDHcC2mKw","scaruffi":null},{"id":231141305096994,"type":"album","name":"Couples","list_id":34001800990688,"list":"RYM Top — Easy Listening — Lounge","src":"musthear","rank":38,"year":1987,"note":null,"yt":"p2MDHcC2mKw","scaruffi":null},{"id":231141305096994,"type":"album","name":"Couples","list_id":268992709620542,"list":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Shibuya-kei","src":"musthear","rank":123,"year":1987,"note":null,"yt":"p2MDHcC2mKw","scaruffi":null},{"id":251090174618652,"type":"album","name":"Bellissima!","list_id":268992709620542,"list":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Shibuya-kei","src":"musthear","ran